    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ecto is a highly-randomized nature world, featuring smooth, addictive movement.  Jump around on colorful, nature-inspired floating islands with your friends or solo. Pick up trinkets, buy and upgrade stick guns, hang out with frogs and fight robots in the underworld. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROADMAP:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[X] Started Development of Ecto (October 2022)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>[X] Prototype Version 1.0 (October 6th 2023)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> [X] Prototype Version 2.0 (January 12th 2024</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> [X] Prototype Version 3.0 (April 4th 2024)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[X] Steam Prototype Release (April 30th 2024)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[X] Pre-Alpha 1.0 | Boss and Progression Update (November 11th 2024)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[X] Pre-Alpha 2.0 | BIG UPDATE / Scavenger Hunt Update (March 13th 2025)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[X] Pre-Alpha 3.0 | Polishing / Content update (June 1st 2025)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[\u00a0 ] Alpha</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[\u00a0 ] Beta</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[\u00a0 ] Full Release</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCLAIMER:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep in mind that Ecto is still in the prototype stage and lacks content. My main goal is to lock in the gameplay fundamentals before I start adding more stuff.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256970/extras/690034f8f825cb256573c0c723cd5a5e.avif?t=1748794283\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leave feedback or just come say hi!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>discord . gg / yYhGzY2dZF</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Steam doesn't